{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 6, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B6", "text_preview": "Share on X"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 7, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B7", "text_preview": "Share on LinkedIn"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 8, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B8", "text_preview": "Share on Reddit"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 9, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B9", "text_preview": "Subscribe to our RSS feed"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 10, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B10", "text_preview": "Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) allows AI systems to provide additional information and context to a large language model (LLM) when generating a response to a user query. However, traditional RAG-based methods can struggle to retrieve"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 11, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B11", "text_preview": "Static vs. dynamic global search"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 12, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B12", "text_preview": "The global search (opens in new tab) algorithm in GraphRAG aims to answer abstract questions that require knowledge of the entire dataset. It generates answers by searching over communities at a predetermined level in the knowledge graph. T"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 13, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B13", "text_preview": "Here, we introduce dynamic community selection to the global search algorithm, which leverages the knowledge graph structure of the indexed dataset. Starting from the root of the knowledge graph, we use an LLM to rate how relevant a communi"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 14, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B14", "text_preview": "The dynamic global search approach has two main benefits. First, it prunes irrelevant reports early on, reducing the total number of community reports to be considered in the map-reduce operation. Second, it enables users to search the enti"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 15, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B15", "text_preview": "Dynamic community selection on the AP News dataset"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 16, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B16", "text_preview": "To demonstrate the cost saving that dynamic global search brings while maintaining a similar response quality, we evaluated the two methods side by side on a dataset from AP News. We tested static and dynamic search on 50 global questions a"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 17, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B17", "text_preview": "We use an LLM evaluator to select the best response (i.e. win rate) on 3 key metrics:"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 18, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B18", "text_preview": "Comprehensiveness: How much detail does the answer provide to cover all the aspects and details of the question?"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 19, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B19", "text_preview": "Diversity: How varied and rich is the answer in providing different perspectives and insights on the question?"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 20, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B20", "text_preview": "Empowerment: How well does the answer help the reader understand and make informed judgements about the topic?"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 21, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B21", "text_preview": "PODCAST SERIES"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 22, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B22", "text_preview": "The AI Revolution in Medicine, Revisited"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 23, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B23", "text_preview": "Join Microsoft’s Peter Lee on a journey to discover how AI is impacting healthcare and what it means for the future of medicine."}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 24, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B24", "text_preview": "Significant cost reduction while maintaining output quality"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 25, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B25", "text_preview": "The quality of responses generated from dynamic community selection are comparable to its static counterpart while reducing the total token cost. Our LLM evaluation shows that the output quality of the two methods is similar in the three ke"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 26, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B26", "text_preview": "Moreover, if we allow dynamic search to continue the rating process further to deeper level community reports, we observe an improvement in its final responses. Here, we conducted the same experiment but allowed dynamic search to continue u"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 27, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B27", "text_preview": "Table 1. LLM evaluation on dynamic search vs static search at different community levels on global questions. We show the win rates of dynamic search at level 1 and level 3 against static search at level 1, that is the number of times the L"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 28, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B28", "text_preview": "Overall, dynamic community selection achieved a cost reduction of 77% while achieving output quality similar to the baseline static approach. These appear to be promising numbers, but what of the result quality? Let’s examine some direct si"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 29, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B29", "text_preview": "Comparable response quality and detail"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 30, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B30", "text_preview": "### Common Trends in Vaccination Rates for Major Diseases"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 31, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B31", "text_preview": "#### Decline in Vaccination Rates"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 32, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B32", "text_preview": "A significant trend observed across various regions is the decline in vaccination rates for major diseases. For instance, Minnesota has experienced a decrease in immunization rates, leading to recent measles outbreaks [Data: Reports (335)]."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 33, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B33", "text_preview": "#### Impact of COVID-19"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 34, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B34", "text_preview": "#### Regional Variations"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 35, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B35", "text_preview": "Vaccination rates vary significantly by region. West Virginia, for example, has one of the strictest school vaccination policies in the U.S., resulting in high child immunization rates [Data: Reports (1199)]. In contrast, Idaho has the high"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 36, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B36", "text_preview": "#### Public Health Initiatives"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 37, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B37", "text_preview": "Various public health initiatives have been implemented to address vaccination rates. The CDC plays a crucial role in monitoring and reporting on vaccination rates for diseases such as measles, mumps, and polio, and provides vital informati"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 38, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B38", "text_preview": "### Conclusion"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 39, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B39", "text_preview": "The dataset reveals a complex landscape of vaccination rates influenced by regional policies, public health initiatives, and the impact of the COVID-19 pandemic. While some regions have managed to maintain high vaccination rates through str"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 40, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B40", "text_preview": "### Common Trends in Vaccination Rates for Major Diseases"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 41, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B41", "text_preview": "#### Decline in Vaccination Rates"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 42, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B42", "text_preview": "A significant trend observed across the dataset is the decline in vaccination rates for various diseases, including measles, mumps, rubella (MMR), and polio. This decline is particularly evident among U.S. kindergartners, where vaccination "}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 43, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B43", "text_preview": "#### Impact of the COVID-19 Pandemic"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 44, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B44", "text_preview": "The COVID-19 pandemic has had a profound impact on vaccination rates. Efforts to promote COVID-19 vaccinations have been a major focus, with initiatives in regions like Michigan and Illinois offering free meals to students and promoting upd"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 45, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B45", "text_preview": "#### Regional Variations and Legislative Measures"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 46, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B46", "text_preview": "There are notable regional variations in vaccination rates and exemption rates across the United States. For example, West Virginia has implemented strict immunization requirements for children entering school, resulting in high child immun"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 47, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B47", "text_preview": "#### Efforts to Improve Vaccination Rates"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 48, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B48", "text_preview": "Various initiatives and legislative measures have been introduced to address declining vaccination rates. For instance, the Government of Sindh introduced a polio vaccination bill that includes provisions for imprisonment for parents who do"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 49, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B49", "text_preview": "### Conclusion"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 50, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B50", "text_preview": "The dataset reveals a complex landscape of vaccination rates influenced by the COVID-19 pandemic, vaccine hesitancy, misinformation, and regional variations. While efforts to improve vaccination rates are ongoing, the decline in immunizatio"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 51, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B51", "text_preview": "Table 2. Generated response from static search (level 1) and dynamic search (level 3) to the same global question on the AP News dataset."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 52, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B52", "text_preview": "Table 2 shows an example output from static search at level 1 and dynamic search at level 3 to the same question. While the two outputs contain similar high-level topics, the response from dynamic search provided specific data such as the r"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 53, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B53", "text_preview": "Overall, dynamic community selection proposes an alternative method to perform global search in GraphRAG by leveraging the indexed knowledge graph and the usage of cheaper LLM models in the rate relevancy operation. These changes led to low"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 54, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B54", "text_preview": "Availability"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 55, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B55", "text_preview": "You can experiment with dynamic global search on the GraphRAG GitHub repository (opens in new tab) ."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 56, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B56", "text_preview": "Dynamic global search is the second of several major optimizations to GraphRAG that are being explored. If you are interested in optimizations for local questions, please check out our recent blog post on DRIFT search . Stay tuned for our u"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/blog-GraphRAG-Improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection--a813613c/document.md", "ordinal": 57, "selector": "web://261e4b7a025f57c1#B57", "text_preview": "Meet the authors"}
